Error [E3203]: `Status` is not a C-compatible type for a foreign function parameter or return.
  --> tests/ui/cffi_e3203_enum_rejected.jet:7:24
    |
  7 |     fn get_status() => Status = "demo_get_status";
    |                        ^^^^^^
 Why: `#Extern` / `#Bindgen` functions must use types with a stable C ABI at the edge.
 Fix: Use scalars, `String`, or a struct with C layout; pointers only through the gated tier.
